,{"text":"Room status"},{"text":"Reservation modification"},{"text":"Check-in/check-out"},{"text":"Guest profiles"},{"text":"Billing"},{"text":"Cancellation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Situational assessment"},{"type":"h","text":"Scenario:"},{"type":"p","text":"A guest arrives after a long journey, but their assigned room is unavailable."},{"type":"p","text":"A strong approach:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Listen","acknowledge inconvenience","verify reservation","coordinate with housekeeping/front office","provide the fastest available solution","keep the guest informed","follow up after resolution"]},{"type":"p","text":"The goal is not simply to quote hotel policy; it is to solve the guest's problem while protecting operational standards."}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An immediate postgraduate degree is not mandatory for becoming a Front Office Associate. Experience can be more valuable during the first few years."},{"type":"p","text":"However, postgraduate study can support management progression."},{"type":"h","text":"Relevant options"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MBA Hospitality Management"},{"text":"MBA Hotel Management"},{"text":"MBA Tourism Management"},{"text":"M.Sc Hospitality Management"},{"text":"PG Diploma in Hotel Management"},{"text":"PG Diploma in Hospitality Management"},{"text":"PG Diploma in Revenue Management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Strong combinations"},{"type":"h","text":"Hospitality + Revenue Management"},{"type":"p","text":"→ Revenue Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Hospitality + Marketing"},{"type":"p","text":"→ Hotel Sales/Marketing"},{"type":"h","text":"Hospitality + Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"→ Hospitality Business Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Hospitality + Operations"},{"type":"p","text":"→ Hotel Operations Management"}]},{"heading":"Study abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Potential postgraduate fields:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"International Hos